### all blogs
GET http://localhost:3003/api/blogs

### add a blog
POST http://localhost:3003/api/blogs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "React patterns",
  "author": "Michael Chan",
  "url": "https://reactpatterns.com/",
  "likes": 7
}

### like a blog (replace the id with one from GET /api/blogs)
PUT http://localhost:3003/api/blogs/5a422a851b54a676234d17f7
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "likes": 8
}

### delete a blog (replace the id with one from GET /api/blogs)
DELETE http://localhost:3003/api/blogs/5a422a851b54a676234d17f7
